# What caused me to look into this...

wasn't being a seasoned dev myself, but seeing all the wonderful studios I love, making a game I just can't run or run poorly. It started with Overwatch 2's and Marvel Rivals' launches; both saw either a hit in performance on a capable 3050 laptop or non-competitive frame rates. Marvel Rivals was especially egregious given their forced UE5 TAA antialiasing solution that looked like my screen was evenly spread with a coat of Vaseline  (which, upon forcing off in the engine.ini, made the game look another flavor of terrible with the dithering)\
